# Kept minimal on purpose: the Rust builder stage in Dockerfile bind-mounts only the paths it
# needs (Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock, app/, crates/, migrations/, migrations-usage/), so `target/` never
# needed excluding here for that stage. web/hosted-login/node_modules is the first thing in this
# repo that actually needs it -- without this file, `docker build .` ships a developer's local
# `npm install` output (and any local `target/`) into the build context on every build.
target
node_modules
web/*/dist
.git
